  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eswatini Drought 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eswatini has been impacted by drought since 2023, impacting the country&#x2019;s agricultural sector and leading to food insecurity.&#xa0;


This operation will support 10,000 people to cope with and recover from the impacts of the persistent drought in the Lubombo region (Lomahasha and Mhlume constituencies).&#xa0;


This operation will continue to address emerging humanitarian needs caused by the existing food insecurity and drought conditions by targeting communities located in the IPC3+ region.&#xa0;


This DF allocation will be earmarked bilaterally to the Baphalali Eswatini Red Cross (BERCS), capitalising on the existing partnership BRC has with them.</narrative>
  </description>
